{{!
    @template tool_vae/correspondence_decision_form

    The form that decides the equivalent of one competency of a replaced record, or takes the decision back: the parameters
    of the page and the session key, hidden; the list of the competencies of the record that replaces and the note, each
    with its label hidden to the eye and read by a screen reader; the button that decides, and the one that takes back once
    a decision stands. A comment carries each line break of the template, so that no space is drawn where the page wrote
    none; the spaces drawn are those the page wrote (a line break after each hidden parameter, one space before the label of
    the note and before each button).

    Every value comes from the context, given by tool_vae\output\correspondence_decision_form. The template holds no logic beyond
    its sections. Every value is escaped (double braces), except one key of HTML (triple braces): labelhtml, the label of a
    competency as format_string() of the core gives it.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * url - string, the address of the page without its parameters, not escaped
    * params - array of {name, value}: the parameters of the page
    * sesskey - string, the session key
    * fromid - int, the competency of the replaced record
    * tolabel - string, the label of the list, for a screen reader
    * options - array of {value, text, labelhtml, selected}: the choices, the text drawn before the label of a competency
    * notelabel - string, the label of the note, for a screen reader
    * maxlength - int, the length a note may have
    * placeholder - string, the words shown in the empty note
    * decide - string, the words of the button that decides
    * undo - bool, whether a decision stands
    * undolabel - string, the words of the button that takes back

    Example context (json):
    {
        "url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/passage.php",
        "params": [{"name": "fiche", "value": "DEMO-GRAND-AGE"}],
        "sesskey": "abcdef1234",
        "fromid": 1,
        "tolabel": "Decide DEMO-GRAND-AGE-BC01",
        "options": [
            {"value": "", "text": "No equivalent decided", "labelhtml": "", "selected": false},
            {"value": "10", "text": "DEMO-GRAND-AGE2-BC01 — ", "labelhtml": "Accompagner la personne", "selected": true}
        ],
        "notelabel": "Note (why) DEMO-GRAND-AGE-BC01",
        "maxlength": 500,
        "placeholder": "Note (why)",
        "decide": "Confirm this equivalent",
        "undo": true,
        "undolabel": "Take back"
    }
}}
<form method="post" action="{{url}}">{{#params}}<input type="hidden" name="{{name}}" value="{{value}}">
{{/params}}{{!
}}<input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">{{!
}}<input type="hidden" name="fromid" value="{{fromid}}">{{!
}}<label for="tool_vae_to_{{fromid}}" class="visually-hidden">{{tolabel}}</label>{{!
}}<select id="tool_vae_to_{{fromid}}" class="select form-select menutoid" name="toid">{{!
}}{{#options}}<option {{#selected}}selected="selected" {{/selected}}value="{{value}}">{{!
}}{{text}}{{{labelhtml}}}</option>{{/options}}{{!
}}</select> {{!
}}<label for="tool_vae_note_{{fromid}}" class="visually-hidden">{{notelabel}}</label>{{!
}}<input type="text" name="note" id="tool_vae_note_{{fromid}}" maxlength="{{maxlength}}" size="30"{{!
}} placeholder="{{placeholder}}"> {{!
}}<button type="submit" name="action" value="decide" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">{{decide}}</button>{{!
}}{{#undo}} <button type="submit" name="action" value="undo" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">{{!
}}{{undolabel}}</button>{{/undo}}{{!
}}</form>
